Find closest point in the tree, relative to a query point, within a search distance
@param QueryPt Find the point closest to this query point
@param DistanceThreshold Limit the search to this distance
@param PredicateFunc Return true if point should be included (i.e., this is a filter)
@param DistSqFunc User-provided squared distance between the point with the given ID and the QueryPt
@param TempBuffer Optional temporary buffer to store a queue of cells (to avoid memory allocations)
@return The ID of the closest point, or INDEX_NONE if no point was found
